{"type":"message","id":"65af60f3","parentId":"8f15a218","timestamp":"2026-04-27T11:32:41.030Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"**Analyzing the SOP**\n\nI've reviewed my `SOUL.md` file and noted the Standard Operating Procedure for the crypto news pipeline. The first step, as I see it, involves clearing the researcher session data. Then, I need to execute the researcher agent. I'm proceeding systematically.\n\n\n**Implementing the Commands**\n\nI'm ready to move past the SOP. The plan is clear: execute the commands in sequence. First, the `rm` command to clear the session file. Then the researcher agent. I've noted that the instructions call for a progress update after the researcher agent is complete. I will implement this now using the exec tool.\n\n\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"tool_exec_fejQSZDGttLFHm3TPxxf","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"rm -f ~/.openclaw/agents/researcher/sessions/sessions.json"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"openrouter","model":"google/gemini-2.5-pro","usage":{"input":9762,"output":213,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":9975,"cost":{"input":0.012202500000000002,"output":0.0021300000000000004,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.014332500000000001}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1777289555275,"responseId":"gen-1777289556-kdpjikDXMwlu4yj1GqSw"}}
