{"type":"message","id":"716ffbb6","parentId":"10a4ea21","timestamp":"2026-04-27T11:33:55.285Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"**Anticipating Pipeline Execution**\n\nI've initiated the crypto news pipeline. Following my protocol, I cleared the researcher's workspace and launched the agent. The agent's still active, gathering intel, so I'm on hold. The next step will be to use whatever resources the agent outputs for the next stage.\n\n\n**Monitoring Process Completion**\n\nI'm still stuck on the researcher's output. The process tool says it is still active, so I am going to poll again. After the process is completed, I'll be able to move on to the next phase as outlined in my `SOUL.md` document. I'm keeping a close eye on it.\n\n\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"tool_process_umJMKQhMTNLqpCIbP2KG","name":"process","arguments":{"sessionId":"cool-orbit","action":"poll","timeout":30000}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"openrouter","model":"google/gemini-2.5-pro","usage":{"input":9943,"output":155,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":10098,"cost":{"input":0.01242875,"output":0.0015500000000000002,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.013978750000000002}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1777289616056,"responseId":"gen-1777289616-HMalmdlyHmOjUIhShtAI"}}
