{"type":"message","id":"b493579b","parentId":"5d9c1a6c","timestamp":"2026-04-27T11:34:32.672Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"**Evaluating the Pipeline's First Step**\n\nI've initiated the crypto news pipeline. The researcher agent was the initial action taken, but encountered a hurdle: a `GatewayClientRequestError` due to credit limitations. Consequently, I'm now proceeding with the suggested alternative using `curl` to fetch the data directly, as per instructions.\n\n\n**Trying the First Alternative**\n\nI encountered a hiccup with the researcher agent failing, so I'm now trying `curl -s 'https://decrypt .co/feed'` as a workaround, as prescribed in my contingency plan. Fingers crossed this simpler approach delivers the required data for the pipeline.\n\n\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning"},{"type":"text","text":"The researcher agent failed to run due to a credits issue. As per my instructions, I will now try to fetch the news feed directly using `curl`."},{"type":"toolCall","id":"tool_exec_Scfobby1i9aBcLY5MK9C","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s 'https://decrypt.co/feed'"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"openrouter","model":"google/gemini-2.5-pro","usage":{"input":10233,"output":149,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":10382,"cost":{"input":0.01279125,"output":0.0014900000000000002,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.01428125}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1777289665307,"responseId":"gen-1777289665-rFyr0PaEkHyihX4i7Hl7"}}
{"type":"message","id":"a78c6080","parentId":"b493579b","timestamp":"2026-04-27T11:34:33.155Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"tool_exec_Scfobby1i9aBcLY5MK9C","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8' ?>\n<rss\n  version=\"2.0\"\n  xmlns:content=\"http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/\"\n  xmlns:wfw=\"http://wellformedweb.org/CommentAPI/\"\n  xmlns:dc=\"http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/\"\n  xmlns:atom=\"http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom\"\n  xmlns:sy=\"http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/syndication/\"\n  xmlns:slash=\"http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/slash/\"\n  xmlns:media=\"http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/\"\n  xmlns:snf=\"http://www.smartnews.be/snf\"\n>\n  <channel>\n    <title>Decrypt</title>\n    <description>What&amp;#039;s new in crypto and the advent of the decentralized web.</description>\n    <language>en</language>\n    \n    <atom:link\n      href=\"https://decrypt.co/feed\"\n      rel=\"self\"\n      type=\"application/rss+xml\"\n    />\n    \n    \n      \n        <link>https://decrypt.co/feed</link>\n      \n    \n    \n      <copyright>Decrypt Media</copyright>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n      <lastBuildDate>Mon, 27 Apr 2026 11:26:44 +0000</lastBuildDate>\n    \n    \n      <sy:updatePeriod>hourly</sy:updatePeriod>\n    \n    \n      <sy:updateFrequency>1</sy:updateFrequency>\n    \n    \n    \n    \n    \n      <item>\n  <title>France Charges 88, Including Minors, in Crypto ‘Wrench Attack’ Crackdown</title>\n  <link>https://decrypt.co/365596/france-charges-88-including-minors-in-crypto-wrench-attack-crackdown</link>\n  <pubDate>Mon, 27 Apr 2026 11:26:44 +0000</pubDate>\n  \n    <description>France has recorded 135 crypto-linked incidents since 2023, amid a nationwide surge in so-called “wrench attacks.&#34;</description>\n  \n  <dc:creator>Vismaya V</dc:creator>\n  \n  \n    <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://decrypt.co/?p=365596</guid>\n  \n  \n    <enclosure url=\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024:512:1:0/plain/https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/Judge-gID_7.png@png\" length=\"1000000\" type=\"image/png\" />\n  \n  \n    \n      <category></category>\n    \n      <category></category>\n    \n      <category>Law and Order</category>\n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n    \n      <media:thumbnail url=\"https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/Judge-gID_7.png\" height=\"2000\" width=\"3556\"/>\n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\n</item>\n    \n      <item>\n  <title>Western Union to Launch Solana-Based Stablecoin Plus ‘Stable Card’ Next Month</title>\n  <link>https://decrypt.co/365593/western-union-to-launch-solana-based-stablecoin-plus-stable-card-next-month</link>\n  <pubDate>Mon, 27 Apr 2026 10:02:52 +0000</pubDate>\n  \n    <description>The USDPT stablecoin launching next month will serve as an alternative to SWIFT for agent settlements rather than consumer transactions.</description>\n  \n  <dc:creator>Decrypt Agent</dc:creator>\n  \n  \n    <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://decrypt.co/?p=365593</guid>\n  \n  \n    <enclosure url=\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024:512:1:0/plain/https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/Western-Union2-gID_7.jpg@png\" length=\"1000000\" type=\"image/png\" />\n  \n  \n    \n      <category></category>\n    \n      <category>Business</category>\n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n    \n      <media:thumbnail url=\"https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/Western-Union2-gID_7.jpg\" height=\"900\" width=\"1600\"/>\n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\n</item>\n    \n      <item>\n  <title>Coachella Uses Google DeepMind AI to Test the Future of Live Entertainment</title>\n  <link>https://decrypt.co/365532/coachella-google-deepmind-ai-test-future-live-entertainment</link>\n  <pubDate>Sun, 26 Apr 2026 19:04:43 +0000</pubDate>\n  \n    <description>Coachella is experimenting with AI-built artist tools, immersive digital worlds, and 3D performance archives that could shape future fan experiences.</description>\n  \n  <dc:creator>Jason Nelson</dc:creator>\n  \n  \n    <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://decrypt.co/?p=365532</guid>\n  \n  \n    <enclosure url=\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024:512:1:0/plain/https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/coachella-2026-ai-cropped-gID_7.png@png\" length=\"1000000\" type=\"image/png\" />\n  \n  \n    \n      <category>Artificial Intelligence</category>\n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n    \n      <media:thumbnail url=\"https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/coachella-2026-ai-cropped-gID_7.png\" height=\"720\" width=\"1280\"/>\n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\n</item>\n    \n      <item>\n  <title>Your AI Agent Can Now Groan While Untangling Your Vibe Coded Mess</title>\n  <link>https://decrypt.co/365511/ai-agent-groan-endless-toil-vibecoding-suffering</link>\n  <pubDate>Sun, 26 Apr 2026 13:01:02 +0000</pubDate>\n  \n    <description>A new GitHub plugin makes your coding agent emit escalating human moans as it suffers through your spaghetti code.</description>\n  \n  <dc:creator>Jose Antonio Lanz</dc:creator>\n  \n  \n    <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://decrypt.co/?p=365511</guid>\n  \n  \n    <enclosure url=\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024:512:1:0/plain/https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/screaming-groaning-ai-vibe-coding-gID_7.jpg@png\" length=\"1000000\" type=\"image/png\" />\n  \n  \n    \n      <category>Artificial Intelligence</category>\n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n    \n      <media:thumbnail url=\"https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/screaming-groaning-ai-vibe-coding-gID_7.jpg\" height=\"720\" width=\"1280\"/>\n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\n</item>\n    \n      <item>\n  <title>Elon Musk’s Grok Most Likely Among Top AI Models to Reinforce Delusions: Study</title>\n  <link>https://decrypt.co/365489/elon-musk-grok-most-likely-ai-reinforce-delusions-study</link>\n  <pubDate>Sat, 25 Apr 2026 19:01:03 +0000</pubDate>\n  \n    <description>Researchers found that xAI&#39;s Grok was the riskiest AI model tested, often validating delusions and offering dangerous advice.</description>\n  \n  <dc:creator>Jason Nelson</dc:creator>\n  \n  \n    <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://decrypt.co/?p=365489</guid>\n  \n  \n    <enclosure url=\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024:512:1:0/plain/https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/Grok-app-on-a-smartphone-screen-gID_7.jpg@png\" length=\"1000000\" type=\"image/png\" />\n  \n  \n    \n      <category>Artificial Intelligence</category>\n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n    \n      <media:thumbnail url=\"https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/Grok-app-on-a-smartphone-screen-gID_7.jpg\" height=\"900\" width=\"1600\"/>\n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\n</item>\n    \n      <item>\n  <title>Bitcoin Hit Its Highest Price Since January—Why VanEck Analysts See More Potential Gains</title>\n  <link>https://decrypt.co/365556/bitcoin-highest-price-january-why-vaneck-analysts-more-gains</link>\n  <pubDate>Sat, 25 Apr 2026 16:31:33 +0000</pubDate>\n  \n    <description>Bitcoin hash rate recovery and negative funding rates signal potential gains ahead, according to the ETF provider&#39;s latest network analysis.</description>\n  \n  <dc:creator>Decrypt Agent</dc:creator>\n  \n  \n    <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://decrypt.co/?p=365556</guid>\n  \n  \n    <enclosure url=\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024:512:1:0/plain/https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Bitcoin-decrypt-style-21-gID_7.png@png\" length=\"1000000\" type=\"image/png\" />\n  \n  \n    \n      <category></category>\n    \n      <category>Markets</category>\n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n    \n      <media:thumbnail url=\"https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Bitcoin-decrypt-style-21-gID_7.png\" height=\"1000\" width=\"1778\"/>\n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\n</item>\n    \n      <item>\n  <title>Brazil Issues Sweeping Ban Against Prediction Market Platforms</title>\n  <link>https://decrypt.co/365509/brazil-sweeping-ban-against-prediction-market-platforms</link>\n  <pubDate>Fri, 24 Apr 2026 21:19:05 +0000</pubDate>\n  \n    <description>Brazil’s Finance Ministry cited investor protection concerns and rising gambling addiction as it blocked platforms like Polymarket and Kalshi.</description>\n  \n  <dc:creator>Decrypt Agent</dc:creator>\n  \n  \n    <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://decrypt.co/?p=365509</guid>\n  \n  \n    <enclosure url=\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024:512:1:0/plain/https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/brazil-technology-shutterstock_1201705168-16x9-1-gID_7.jpg@png\" length=\"1000000\" type=\"image/png\" />\n  \n  \n    \n      <category>Law and Order</category>\n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n    \n      <media:thumbnail url=\"https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/brazil-technology-shutterstock_1201705168-16x9-1-gID_7.jpg\" height=\"1350\" width=\"2400\"/>\n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\n</item>\n    \n      <item>\n  <title>Tennessee Becomes Second State to Outlaw Bitcoin, Crypto ATMs</title>\n  <link>https://decrypt.co/365502/tennessee-second-state-outlaw-bitcoin-crypto-atms</link>\n  <pubDate>Fri, 24 Apr 2026 20:41:13 +0000</pubDate>\n  \n    <description>Tennessee has become the second U.S. state to outlaw Bitcoin and crypto ATMs, making it a criminal offense to own or operate the machines.</description>\n  \n  <dc:creator>André Beganski</dc:creator>\n  \n  \n    <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://decrypt.co/?p=365502</guid>\n  \n  \n    <enclosure url=\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024:512:1:0/plain/https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/shutterstock_1261474762-gID_7.jpg@png\" length=\"1000000\" type=\"image/png\" />\n  \n  \n    \n      <category></category>\n    \n      <category>Law and Order</category>\n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n    \n      <media:thumbnail url=\"https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/shutterstock_1261474762-gID_7.jpg\" height=\"1067\" width=\"1600\"/>\n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\n</item>\n    \n      <item>\n  <title>Trump DOJ Backs Elon Musk&#39;s xAI in Fight Over Colorado AI Bias Law</title>\n  <link>https://decrypt.co/365504/trump-doj-backs-elon-musk-xai-colorado-ai-bias-law</link>\n  <pubDate>Fri, 24 Apr 2026 20:30:05 +0000</pubDate>\n  \n    <description>The Justice Department moved to intervene in xAI’s lawsuit challenging Colorado’s algorithmic discrimination law.</description>\n  \n  <dc:creator>Jason Nelson</dc:creator>\n  \n  \n    <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://decrypt.co/?p=365504</guid>\n  \n  \n    <enclosure url=\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024:512:1:0/plain/https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/elon-musk-decrypt-style-01-gID_7.png@png\" length=\"1000000\" type=\"image/png\" />\n  \n  \n    \n      <category>Artificial Intelligence</category>\n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n    \n      <media:thumbnail url=\"https://cdn.decrypt.co/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/elon-musk-decrypt-style-01-gID_7.png\" height=\"2000\" width=\"3556\"/>\n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n\n\n</item>\n    \n      <item>\n  <title>South Korea Arrests Man for a Fake AI Wolf Photo That Raised Alarms</title>\n  <link>https://decrypt.co/365490/south-korea-arrests-man-for-a-fake-ai-wolf-photo-that-raised-alarms</link>\n  <pubDate>Fri, 24 Apr 2026 19:58:44 +0000</pubDate>\n  \n    <description>A man created an AI-generated image of escaped wolf Neukgu &#34;for fun.&#34; It fooled authorities, triggered emergency alerts, and derailed a nine-day search operation.</description>\n  \n  <dc:creator>Jose Antonio Lanz</dc:creator>\n  \n  \n    <guid isPermaLink=\"false\">https://decrypt.co/?p=365490</guid>\n  \n  \n    <enclosure url=\"https://img.decrypt.co/insecure/rs:fill:1024: