{"type":"message","id":"bfd86fbf","parentId":"af67ed7b","timestamp":"2026-04-27T11:35:56.231Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The web search failed. I will proceed with the information from the Decrypt RSS feed.\n\nThe most significant news seems to be \"Western Union to Launch Solana-Based Stablecoin Plus ‘Stable Card’ Next Month\". I will now proceed to the next step and have the writer agent write an article on this. First, I will formulate the `RESEARCH_JSON` from the article \"Western Union to Launch Solana-Based Stablecoin Plus ‘Stable Card’ Next Month\".\n\nHere is the JSON I've constructed:\n```json\n{\n  \"title\": \"Western Union to Launch Solana-Based Stablecoin Plus ‘Stable Card’ Next Month\",\n  \"source\": \"Decrypt\",\n  \"url\": \"https://decrypt.co/365593/western-union-to-launch-solana-based-stablecoin-plus-stable-card-next-month\",\n  \"publication_date\": \"Mon, 27 Apr 2026 10:02:52 +0000\",\n  \"summary\": \"Western Union is launching a Solana-based stablecoin, USDPT, and a 'Stable Card' next month. The stablecoin is intended for agent settlements, offering an alternative to the SWIFT network, and is not aimed at consumer transactions.\",\n  \"key_points\": [\n    \"Western Union is launching a new stablecoin called USDPT.\",\n    \"The stablecoin will be based on the Solana blockchain.\",\n    \"A 'Stable Card' will be launched alongside the stablecoin.\",\n    \"The launch is scheduled for next month.\",\n    \"USDPT is designed for agent settlements, not for consumers.\",\n    \"It will serve as an alternative to the SWIFT network.\"\n  ],\n  \"protagonist\": \"Western Union\",\n  \"antagonist\": \"SWIFT\"\n}\n```\n\nNow, I will proceed with the \"Write\" step of the pipeline."},{"type":"toolCall","id":"tool_exec_L6PJr5doQBY9fiZN8w0F","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"rm -f ~/.openclaw/agents/writer/sessions/sessions.json"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"openrouter","model":"google/gemini-2.5-pro"